Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:03.91,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,440)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.75,0:01:10.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,美味
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.75,0:01:10.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Delicious
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.25,0:01:41.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,脱帽道早安
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.25,0:01:41.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Top of the mornin' to you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.02,0:01:53.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里是蟹堡王  我是海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.02,0:01:53.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krusty Krab, SpongeBob speaking
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.55,0:01:58.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.55,0:01:58.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, is that you?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.74,0:02:00.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小蜗  我知道是你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.74,0:02:00.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Gary, I know you're there
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.99,0:02:02.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都听到你的呼吸声了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.99,0:02:02.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can hear you breathing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.03,0:02:20.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,一根热狗之后
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.42,0:02:23.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.42,0:02:23.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.31,0:02:25.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这根热狗味道好像蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.31,0:02:25.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This weiner tastes just like a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.75,0:02:27.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许可以加进菜单里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.75,0:02:27.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can add them to the menu
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.45,0:02:28.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没什么了不起的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.45,0:02:28.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not impressed
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.50,0:02:30.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是用边角料做的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:30.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I made it with leftover ingredients
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.65,0:02:32.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下还挺了不起的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.65,0:02:32.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now I'm impressed
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.26,0:02:39.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,店门的牌子肯定写的是开来着
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.26,0:02:39.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I could've sworn that sign said "open"
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.90,0:02:47.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我时不时地需要透气  免于吸入油烟
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.90,0:02:47.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Once in a while I need to breathe in and not smell grease
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.70,0:02:50.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,或是我惨败一生中的臭气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.70,0:02:50.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,or the stench of my miserably failed life
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.17,0:02:54.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又在自言自语
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:54.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Talking to myself
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.74,0:02:55.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.74,0:02:55.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Again
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.32,0:02:59.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,然后我就这么煮了它
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.32,0:02:59.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And then I just cook it like this
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.57,0:03:02.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,继续
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:02.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Go on
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.77,0:03:05.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,天啊  好有趣的形状
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.77,0:03:05.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My, what an interesting shape
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.45,0:03:06.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那些有在卖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.45,0:03:06.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Are those for sale?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.02,0:03:07.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,问这干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.02,0:03:07.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.72,0:03:08.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是要买吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.72,0:03:08.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you like to buy one?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.02,0:03:09.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.02,0:03:09.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.75,0:03:11.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得看要卖多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.75,0:03:11.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That would depend on the price
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.71,0:03:13.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,愿意花跟蟹黄堡一样的价钱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.71,0:03:13.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Would you pay the same as what a Krabby Patty costs?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.05,0:03:16.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好啊  可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.05,0:03:16.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure, I suppose so
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.00,0:03:18.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,双倍价格呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:18.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How about double?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.85,0:03:20.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这才对嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.85,0:03:20.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now you're talking
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.51,0:03:22.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,又是蟹黄堡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.51,0:03:22.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krabby Patties again?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.85,0:03:26.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,有别的花样就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.85,0:03:26.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If only there were something else
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.43,0:03:29.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你手上那是什么  法兰克
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.43,0:03:29.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What you got there, Frank?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.01,0:03:30.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是新品
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.01,0:03:30.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's new
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.22,0:03:31.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,味道很像蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.22,0:03:31.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tastes just like a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.82,0:03:34.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但形状很像热狗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.82,0:03:34.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but it's shaped like a weiner
Dialogue: 3,0:03:34.44,0:03:36.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,听起来很有趣
Dialogue: 2,0:03:34.44,0:03:36.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That sounds very interesting
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.20,0:03:40.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要一根热狗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:40.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd like to request a weiner
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.54,0:03:41.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.54,0:03:41.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me too
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.22,0:03:41.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.22,0:03:41.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Me too
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.00,0:03:44.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,热狗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:44.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wieners
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:48.79,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(726,148)}菜单
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.00,0:03:51.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  那是什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:51.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, what's that noise?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.52,0:03:52.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,折磨人的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.52,0:03:52.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excruciating
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.83,0:03:53.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看上面  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.83,0:03:53.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Up here, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.17,0:03:54.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,瞧一瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.17,0:03:54.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Take a look
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.94,0:03:57.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,站这里看不到  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.94,0:03:57.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can't read it from here, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.84,0:03:58.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上面写什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.84,0:03:58.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's it say?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.02,0:04:02.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,上面写  蟹热狗只要三块九毛九
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.02,0:04:02.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It says, "Krusty Dogs only $3.99
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.84,0:04:05.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加奶酪四块九毛九
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.84,0:04:05.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,or $4.99 with cheese"
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.63,0:04:06.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,四块九毛九吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.63,0:04:06.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,$4.99?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.72,0:04:08.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,简直是拦路抢劫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.72,0:04:08.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's highway robbery
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.45,0:04:10.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加奶酪哦  章鱼哥先生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.45,0:04:10.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Avec fromage, monsieur Squidward
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.45,0:04:12.35,注释,,0,0,0,,[ 法语 ]
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.95,0:04:12.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,加奶酪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.95,0:04:12.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,avec fromage
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.76,0:04:14.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的蟹热狗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.76,0:04:14.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My Krusty Dog
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.47,0:04:15.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,被手写到了菜单上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.47,0:04:15.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Handwritten on the menu
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.56,0:04:17.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,掐我一把  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:17.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pinch me, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.70,0:04:19.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要掐自己掐  傻子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:19.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pinch yourself, you ninny
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.23,0:04:20.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,75,,第二天
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.82,0:04:25.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  马上再做三个蟹热狗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:25.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, three more Krusty Dogs, pronto
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.42,0:04:26.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,遵命  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.42,0:04:26.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aye-aye, cap'n
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.07,0:04:27.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.07,0:04:27.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.15,0:04:30.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再来三份蟹热狗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.15,0:04:30.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Three more orders of Krusty Dogs
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.22,0:04:31.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要多蟹一点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.22,0:04:31.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,extra krusty
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.41,0:04:32.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.41,0:04:32.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wow, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.83,0:04:35.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹热狗的订单真是越来越多了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.83,0:04:35.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we sure are getting a lot of orders for Krusty Dogs
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.52,0:04:36.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.52,0:04:36.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yep
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.48,0:04:39.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好  做完这几个蟹黄堡就去做热狗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.48,0:04:37.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll get those going
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.46,0:04:39.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,right after I finish cooking up these Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.41,0:04:42.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做蟹黄堡的事你别管
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.41,0:04:42.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Forget about making those patties
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.18,0:04:43.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做热狗就好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.18,0:04:43.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just make the wieners
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.63,0:04:46.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,做热狗就好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.63,0:04:46.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Just make the wieners"?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.33,0:04:48.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.33,0:04:48.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.25,0:04:51.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你带着那梯子是要去哪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:51.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are you going with that ladder?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.37,0:04:52.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.37,0:04:52.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.25,0:04:56.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只是要稍微改下蟹堡王菜单  没别的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:54.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to make a few changes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.31,0:04:56.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to the Krusty Krab menu, that's all
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.23,0:04:56.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,改菜单
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.23,0:04:56.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Changes?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.38,0:04:58.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:04:58.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That reminds me
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.52,0:05:00.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以借我个橡皮擦吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:05:00.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Do you have an eraser I could borrow?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.91,0:05:01.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,橡皮擦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.91,0:05:01.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eraser?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.95,0:05:03.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没事了  直接划掉算了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.95,0:05:03.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Never mind, I'll just cross it off
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.41,0:05:07.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不卖蟹黄堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.41,0:05:07.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No more Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.40,0:05:14.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不卖蟹黄堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.40,0:05:14.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No more Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.94,0:05:21.59,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.94,0:05:21.59,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.59,0:05:23.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正常呼吸  孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.59,0:05:23.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just breathe normally, son
Dialogue: 3,0:05:23.06,0:05:25.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不卖蟹黄堡了
Dialogue: 2,0:05:23.06,0:05:25.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No more Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.22,0:05:26.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,行了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.22,0:05:26.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There you go
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.95,0:05:28.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.95,0:05:28.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's it
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.47,0:05:29.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:29.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.01,0:05:30.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他醒过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.01,0:05:30.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He's starting to revive
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.40,0:05:32.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我做了个噩梦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.40,0:05:32.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I had this horrible dream
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.00,0:05:35.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,梦见蟹老板再也不让我做蟹黄堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:33.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that Mr. Krabs was never gonna let me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:35.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,cook Krabby Patties again
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.85,0:05:42.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.85,0:05:42.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pardon me
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.10,0:05:47.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他快不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.10,0:05:47.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're losing him
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.28,0:05:50.82,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(656,880)}垃圾堆
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.54,0:05:53.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.54,0:05:53.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.70,0:05:55.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:55.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.23,0:05:58.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,醒醒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:58.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wake up
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.32,0:06:00.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.32,0:06:00.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.38,0:06:03.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这些医生在这干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:03.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And what are these paramedics doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.70,0:06:06.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你回到了你的老厨房
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.70,0:06:06.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're back in your old kitchen
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.12,0:06:09.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这俩医生是来救醒你的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.12,0:06:09.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and the pair of paramedics were here to revive you
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.30,0:06:10.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我刚昏过去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.30,0:06:10.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was asleep?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.60,0:06:11.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.60,0:06:11.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.57,0:06:13.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过就一小会儿而已
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.57,0:06:13.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But just for a little while
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.08,0:06:15.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我只扣了你昏迷不醒期间的工资
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.08,0:06:14.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So I only docked your pay
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.26,0:06:15.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,for the time you were unconscious
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.73,0:06:20.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板  那个位置原本不是烤架吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.73,0:06:20.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs, isn't that where the grill used to be?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:20.67,0:06:21.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.67,0:06:21.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.30,0:06:24.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但现在有这个了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:24.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But now we have this
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:27.40,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(402,836)}热狗
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.40,0:06:28.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那我的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.40,0:06:28.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And what about my--
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.57,0:06:30.61,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的锅铲呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.57,0:06:30.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,my spatula?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.61,0:06:32.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要给你个新的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.61,0:06:32.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I got you a new one
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.85,0:06:43.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好了  热狗可不会自己烤自己
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.85,0:06:42.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,All right, those wieners
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.00,0:06:43.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,aren't gonna rotisserie themselves
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.82,0:06:45.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全都回去工作
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:45.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Everybody back to work
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.20,0:06:50.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,遵命  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.20,0:06:50.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aye-aye, captain
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.91,0:06:55.81,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  我能跟你聊一小会儿吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.91,0:06:55.81,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, can I talk to you for one second?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.05,0:06:56.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.05,0:06:56.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 1,0:06:56.82,0:06:58.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一小会儿也太久了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.82,0:06:58.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty long talk
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.18,0:07:00.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你的工作里有没有出过什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.18,0:07:00.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Has anything ever happened at your job
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.46,0:07:03.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,搞得  再也没以前那么快乐了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.46,0:07:03.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that made it, well, not as fun as it used to be
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.93,0:07:05.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还真有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.93,0:07:05.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, yes
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.57,0:07:06.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.57,0:07:06.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.19,0:07:06.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.19,0:07:06.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What was it
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.95,0:07:07.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,被录用
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.95,0:07:07.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Being hired
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.11,0:07:09.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:09.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I don't know why
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.30,0:07:13.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,自从蟹热狗进菜单  一切都不一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.30,0:07:10.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but things just aren't the same
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.90,0:07:13.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,since Krusty Dogs were added to the menu
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.17,0:07:14.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  我的小子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.17,0:07:14.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, my boy
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.50,0:07:17.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我很久以前就意识到没有东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:17.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I realized long ago that there is nothing
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.16,0:07:22.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,重复  没有东西能让这份工作更无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:19.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I repeat, nothing that could
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.23,0:07:22.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,make this job any more boring
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.03,0:07:24.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,更丢脸  更低人一等
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.03,0:07:24.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,or humiliating or demeaning
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.65,0:07:26.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,比现在这样还严重
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.65,0:07:26.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,than it already is
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.71,0:07:38.60,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(204,686)}尝尝全新\N蟹热狗
Dialogue: 1,0:07:29.57,0:07:32.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看他穿得好像热狗一样  老妈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.57,0:07:32.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look at that guy dressed like a hot dog, mommy
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.45,0:07:34.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好好上学才不会跟他一样  比利
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.45,0:07:34.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let that inspire you to stay in school, Billy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.60,0:07:41.39,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(746,184)}蟹热狗
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.57,0:07:41.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:41.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.39,0:07:42.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.39,0:07:42.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ahoy, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.91,0:07:44.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,热狗怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.91,0:07:44.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How goes the wieners?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.44,0:07:45.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:45.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Meh
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.38,0:07:46.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在想
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.38,0:07:46.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I was kind of wondering
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.57,0:07:48.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,能不能变回以前那样继续卖蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.57,0:07:48.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,could we just go back to selling Krabby Patties?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.58,0:07:51.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,卖那个干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.58,0:07:51.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What on earth for?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.07,0:07:54.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹热狗可是你最棒的点子  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.07,0:07:54.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Krusty Dogs was your best idea ever, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.05,0:07:55.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道  我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.05,0:07:55.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know, I--
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.17,0:07:58.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来我是有那么点想念蟹黄堡了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.17,0:07:58.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I sort of just miss the Krabby Patties
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.37,0:08:01.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,毕竟  蟹堡王的名字出自蟹黄堡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.37,0:08:01.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,After all, they're what gave this place its name
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.77,0:08:03.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,确实在理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.77,0:08:03.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good point
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.42,0:08:05.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  你不觉得我们应该要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.42,0:08:05.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean, don't you think that we should--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.96,0:08:12.42,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(220,426)}蟹狗王
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.30,0:08:12.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹狗王
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:12.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Krusty Dog"?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:12.77,0:08:15.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那些热狗必须消失
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.77,0:08:15.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Those wieners have got to go
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.75,0:08:18.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请慢用  饿肚子的客人们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.75,0:08:18.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here you are, hungry customers
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.42,0:08:20.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给你们端上美味蟹热狗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.42,0:08:20.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,your delicious Krusty Dogs
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.25,0:08:22.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看着就好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.25,0:08:22.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,They do look delicious
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.14,0:08:23.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.14,0:08:23.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.98,0:08:26.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吃一个  皮肤就会得皮肤病毁容
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.98,0:08:25.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Eat one and you will develop
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.19,0:08:26.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,an unsightly skin condition
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.37,0:08:28.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一尺长的热狗来了  先生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.37,0:08:28.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here's your foot long, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.10,0:08:29.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.10,0:08:29.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.09,0:08:32.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,十二寸长的美味
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.09,0:08:32.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,12 inches of deliciousness
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.20,0:08:33.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.20,0:08:33.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.15,0:08:34.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,知道是什么造就了此般美味吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.15,0:08:34.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You know, what gives them that added flavor?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.82,0:08:36.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不知道  什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.82,0:08:36.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, what?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.57,0:08:38.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,鼻毛和回收的牙线
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.57,0:08:38.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nose hairs and recycled dental floss
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.16,0:08:42.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.16,0:08:42.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.00,0:08:47.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,必须除掉这些热狗  让蟹黄堡回归
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:45.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We have got to get rid of these wieners
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.04,0:08:47.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and bring back the Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.58,0:08:50.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  没想到我会这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:50.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, I never thought I'd be saying this
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.83,0:08:52.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但算我一个
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.83,0:08:52.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but count me in
Dialogue: 1,0:08:53.25,0:08:54.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.25,0:08:54.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hooray
Dialogue: 1,0:08:57.10,0:08:58.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,救命
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.10,0:08:58.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Help
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.42,0:09:03.23,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我肚子好疼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.42,0:09:03.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm having terrible abdominal pain
Dialogue: 1,0:09:03.91,0:09:05.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一定都是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.91,0:09:05.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think it was the
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.37,0:09:06.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.37,0:09:06.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.93,0:09:08.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,台词
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.93,0:09:08.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Line
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.72,0:09:10.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,热狗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.72,0:09:10.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Weiner
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.70,0:09:13.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个热狗害的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.70,0:09:13.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The weiner
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.78,0:09:14.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:14.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.74,0:09:16.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,请容我自我介绍一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.74,0:09:16.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,allow me to introduce myself
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.80,0:09:19.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我只是个老派的老绅士
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:19.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I am but a simple old-timey gentleman
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.64,0:09:22.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,今天来这里只为了一个目的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.64,0:09:22.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I came here for one purpose today
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.01,0:09:24.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以我就说  闻着没那么臭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.01,0:09:24.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So I said, "it didn't smell so bad
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.89,0:09:25.98,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,但吃着
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.89,0:09:25.98,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"but it taste--
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.98,0:09:27.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别吵  老太婆
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:27.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Quiet, granny
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.04,0:09:28.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我在讲话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.04,0:09:28.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm talkin'
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.37,0:09:31.96,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就是要强烈反对
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.37,0:09:31.96,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And that is to loudly decry
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.96,0:09:35.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,当今这种现代又新潮的热狗时代
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.96,0:09:35.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,these modern new-fangled days of wieners
Dialogue: 1,0:09:35.07,0:09:39.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,恳求回归一个更为单纯的年代
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.07,0:09:39.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and to beg for a return to a simpler time
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.45,0:09:42.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹黄堡年代
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.45,0:09:42.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a krabby pattier time
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.65,0:09:47.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不咋担心那东西会对健康有啥危害
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:46.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not really concerned
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.06,0:09:47.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,about possible ill health effects
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.90,0:09:48.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们大家呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.90,0:09:48.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How about you guys?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.86,0:09:49.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也不
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.86,0:09:49.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nah
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.54,0:09:50.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那怀旧怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.54,0:09:50.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How about nostalgia?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.15,0:09:52.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没听说过
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.15,0:09:52.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Never heard of 'em
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.32,0:09:54.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧  完全行不通
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:54.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, that didn't work at all
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.92,0:09:57.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,似乎只让客人更想吃热狗了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.92,0:09:57.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It only seemed to increase their appetite for wieners
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.32,0:09:59.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得要更强力的战术
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.32,0:09:59.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We need stronger tactics
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.00,0:10:00.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.00,0:10:00.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Right
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.54,0:10:03.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要能让蟹老板的整个热狗事业
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.54,0:10:03.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Something that would make Mr. Krabs' whole weiner thing
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.30,0:10:04.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,在他面前烂到爆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.30,0:10:04.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,blow right up in his face
Dialogue: 1,0:10:04.52,0:10:05.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.52,0:10:05.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.95,0:10:06.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,爆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.95,0:10:06.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Blow up
Dialogue: 1,0:10:07.91,0:10:09.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,章鱼哥  有了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.91,0:10:09.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Squidward, that's it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.08,0:10:11.79,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1024,424)}气球
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.60,0:10:21.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.60,0:10:21.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Beautiful
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.73,0:10:25.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,先生  你的蟹热狗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.73,0:10:25.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your Krusty Dog, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.06,0:10:26.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多加芥末酱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.06,0:10:26.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with extra mustard
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.19,0:10:26.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.19,0:10:26.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks
Dialogue: 1,0:10:26.95,0:10:28.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再要来点别的什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.95,0:10:28.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Can I bring you something else?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.22,0:10:32.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧  看来不要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.22,0:10:32.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, I guess not
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.98,0:10:33.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢谢先生
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.98,0:10:33.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.28,0:10:39.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等待时机  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:39.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait for it, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.72,0:10:40.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等待时机
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.72,0:10:40.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,wait for it
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.76,0:10:41.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就现在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:41.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Now
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.33,0:10:46.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对  还记得吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.33,0:10:46.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah, remember that?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.47,0:10:46.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那真
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.47,0:10:46.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was--
Dialogue: 1,0:10:46.82,0:10:48.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的海神王啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.82,0:10:48.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, my Neptune
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.10,0:10:50.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那个蟹热狗就要爆炸了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.10,0:10:50.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That Krusty Dog is about to explode
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.90,0:10:51.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:51.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.83,0:10:52.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.83,0:10:52.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.95,0:11:00.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都溅到我身上了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.95,0:11:00.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's all over me
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.20,0:11:01.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我  我好像要吐了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.20,0:11:01.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I-I think I'm gonna be sick
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.60,0:11:03.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得跟我孙子孙女说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:03.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tell my grandchildren about that
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.88,0:11:05.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.88,0:11:05.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Have a nice day
Dialogue: 1,0:11:05.15,0:11:07.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  这里是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.15,0:11:07.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, what happened in here?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.72,0:11:09.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我客人都跑哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.72,0:11:09.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where are all me customers?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.57,0:11:10.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这下怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.57,0:11:10.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.10,0:11:13.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我知道怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.10,0:11:13.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know the answer
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.20,0:11:18.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  看见章鱼哥没
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.20,0:11:18.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, SpongeBob, have you seen Mr. Squidward?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.07,0:11:19.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,应该是在外面休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:19.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think he's outside on his break
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.05,0:11:21.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,完美
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.05,0:11:21.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.20,0:11:23.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,继续好好做蟹黄堡  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:23.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And keep them Krabby Patties coming, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.08,0:11:25.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,遵命  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.08,0:11:25.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Aye-aye, captain
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.78,0:11:27.41,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(280,558)}回归了
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.50,0:11:31.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,老妈  快看他穿得好像蟹黄堡一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:31.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mom, look it's a guy dressed as a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 1,0:11:31.71,0:11:35.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,挑个好大学得趁早  比利
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.71,0:11:33.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's never too soon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:35.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to start picking a good college, Billy
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.21,0:11:44.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来我又错了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.21,0:11:44.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I was wrong again
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.70,0:11:47.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,永远都有更丢脸的事等着我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:47.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It can always get more humiliating
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.35,0:11:51.89,起司 一般标题,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fsp40\c&H00FFD9&}梦不落号\N{\fs30} \N{\fs175}沉船探险
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.10,0:11:56.77,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1096,976.667)}翻译{\fnArial}: 1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.10,0:11:54.35,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(237.33,454)}分镜总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.10,0:11:54.35,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(475.661,716)}编剧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.48,0:11:56.77,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(387.575,412)}创意总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.48,0:11:56.77,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(511.742,668)}动画总监
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.90,0:11:59.32,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\frz29.85\pos(431.6,534)}制片指导
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.90,0:11:59.32,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1034.667,976.667)}本字幕仅限学习交流\N严禁用于商业用途
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.12,0:12:06.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你当鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.12,0:12:06.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're it
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.99,0:12:09.33,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,马上就不当了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.99,0:12:09.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not for long
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.29,0:12:14.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来抓我啊  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.29,0:12:14.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Try and catch me, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.82,0:12:18.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抓到了  你当鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.82,0:12:18.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tag, you're it
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.29,0:12:21.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这游戏太难了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.29,0:12:21.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This game's too hard
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.07,0:12:22.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.07,0:12:22.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I know
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.27,0:12:24.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是我们俩一起当鬼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.27,0:12:24.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What if both of us are it?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:24.67,0:12:27.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那谁来当不是鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.67,0:12:27.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But, then, who's gonna be not it?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.76,0:12:29.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊  我们俩都不知道是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.76,0:12:29.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Exactly, neither of us will know
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.90,0:12:34.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我喜欢不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.90,0:12:34.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I like not knowing
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.10,0:12:35.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.10,0:12:35.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's play
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.77,0:12:43.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我当鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.77,0:12:43.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm it
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.02,0:12:47.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.02,0:12:47.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.25,0:12:49.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,撑住
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.25,0:12:49.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hang on
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.78,0:12:50.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.78,0:12:50.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm coming
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.89,0:12:58.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是什么地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.89,0:12:58.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:59.54,0:13:00.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看看这酷东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.54,0:13:00.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Look at all this cool stuff
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.35,0:13:07.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我是船长
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.35,0:13:07.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm the captain
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.35,0:13:10.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,船员们好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.35,0:13:10.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ya mateys
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.57,0:13:17.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看剑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.57,0:13:17.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,En garde
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.37,0:13:25.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谢了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.37,0:13:25.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.37,0:13:27.39,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.37,0:13:27.39,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I guess we better be more careful
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.39,0:13:28.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,回到主甲板上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.39,0:13:28.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go back to the main deck
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.70,0:13:29.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.70,0:13:29.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.16,0:13:33.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.16,0:13:33.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.67,0:13:35.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我来了  兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.67,0:13:35.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm coming, buddy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:36.27,0:13:36.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.27,0:13:36.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.83,0:13:39.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.83,0:13:39.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:41.04,0:13:43.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,闪亮又光滑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.04,0:13:43.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Shiny and smooth
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.29,0:13:48.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.29,0:13:48.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.01,0:13:50.43,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1064,236)}梦不落号
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.37,0:13:50.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,梦不落号
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.37,0:13:50.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Mauna loa"
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.16,0:13:52.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.16,0:13:52.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm late
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.82,0:13:53.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得上班去了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.82,0:13:53.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Got to get to work
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.93,0:13:57.35,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(258,386)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.66,0:13:57.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,梦不落号
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.66,0:13:57.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mauna loa
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.72,0:13:58.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我好爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.72,0:13:58.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How I love ya
Dialogue: 1,0:13:58.67,0:14:01.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可爱的秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.67,0:14:01.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Secret lovin' hideaway
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.24,0:14:03.86,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我的梦不落号  宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.24,0:14:03.86,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,My mauna loa bay-yay-bee
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.86,0:14:05.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.86,0:14:05.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.55,0:14:07.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.55,0:14:07.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.17,0:14:08.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝  你在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.17,0:14:08.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.71,0:14:12.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都说我了无数次要来份蟹黄堡  你却
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.71,0:14:10.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've been saying I need a Krabby Patty
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.28,0:14:12.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,about a bajillion times, and you--
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.80,0:14:13.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:13.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.09,0:14:17.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,肉饼不错嘛  大雕塑家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.09,0:14:17.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nice patty, Michelangelo
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.42,0:14:20.99,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,希望你没指望这玩意能拿奖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.42,0:14:20.99,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I hope you're not expecting an award any time soon
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.95,0:14:24.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那只是我的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.95,0:14:24.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's just my secret--
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.01,0:14:28.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.01,0:14:28.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Here you go
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.07,0:14:31.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怪海绵
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.07,0:14:31.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Porous freak
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.47,0:14:33.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.47,0:14:33.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was close
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.30,0:14:34.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.30,0:14:34.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.67,0:14:37.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快看我新做的短袖
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.67,0:14:37.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Check out the new t-shirt I just made
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.77,0:14:37.81,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(686,268)}跟我去梦不落号
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.81,0:14:39.37,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.81,0:14:39.37,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Secret hideout
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.37,0:14:40.73,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.37,0:14:40.73,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Secret hideout
Dialogue: 1,0:14:40.73,0:14:42.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:42.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Secret hideout
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.40,0:14:43.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.40,0:14:43.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Secret hideout
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.74,0:14:45.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.74,0:14:45.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Secret hideout
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.17,0:14:46.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘密基
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.17,0:14:46.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Secret hide--
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.27,0:14:47.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  不要闹
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.27,0:14:47.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, please
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.75,0:14:49.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这是在干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.75,0:14:49.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to do
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.27,0:14:51.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,暴露我们的秘密基地吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.27,0:14:51.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,give away our secret hideout?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.97,0:14:52.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.97,0:14:52.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Give me that
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.63,0:14:55.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,吵什么吵
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.63,0:14:55.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's with all the racket?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.18,0:14:57.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.18,0:14:57.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,S-sorry, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.12,0:14:59.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  既然想害我的厨子分心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.12,0:14:59.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, if you're gonna distract me fry cook
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.50,0:15:01.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,起码也得先买点吃的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.50,0:15:01.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the least you could do is buy some grub
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.40,0:15:03.01,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没问题  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:03.01,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You got it, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.54,0:15:04.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,继续工作  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:04.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Back to work, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.57,0:15:05.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.57,0:15:05.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sure thing
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.34,0:15:09.51,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(998,862)}蟹堡王
Dialogue: 1,0:15:12.98,0:15:14.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来下班时间到了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:14.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like the work day is over
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.07,0:15:14.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,明天见  老板
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.07,0:15:14.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow, sir
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.02,0:15:16.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.02,0:15:16.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.00,0:15:17.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:17.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Odd
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.05,0:15:20.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我找找
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.05,0:15:20.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.62,0:15:21.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快点  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.62,0:15:21.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:15:21.62,0:15:22.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,得回到我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.62,0:15:22.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We have to get back to our
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.10,0:15:24.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,游乐场
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.10,0:15:24.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Playground
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.46,0:15:26.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不用找了  老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.46,0:15:26.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Keep the change, my good man
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.57,0:15:29.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一张口香糖包装纸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.57,0:15:29.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,A gum wrapper
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.79,0:15:31.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,还有一枚印着梦不落号的硬币
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.79,0:15:31.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and a coin that says "mauna loa"
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.74,0:15:33.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,梦不落号
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.74,0:15:33.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mauna loa?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.53,0:15:35.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就那艘梦不落号沉船吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:35.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,As in the shipwreck mauna loa?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.66,0:15:40.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,传说未曾寻获的最大海盗宝藏就藏在
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.66,0:15:36.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Legend has it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.79,0:15:40.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,that the largest unfound pirate's booty lies
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.46,0:15:41.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,它的残骸里
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.46,0:15:41.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In its ruins
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.99,0:15:45.78,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我成年以来几乎一直在寻找这宝藏
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.99,0:15:43.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I've been searching for this treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:45.78,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,nearly me entire adult life
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.98,0:15:48.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找遍了每个角落  每个缝隙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.98,0:15:48.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,looking over every nook, every cranny
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.25,0:15:49.52,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,每个垃圾箱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.25,0:15:49.52,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,every dumpster
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.03,0:15:51.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,一旦宝藏到了我手上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:51.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Once I get me claws on it
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.85,0:15:54.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就是世上最有钱的甲壳动物了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.85,0:15:54.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll be the richest crustacean in the world
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.80,0:15:57.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那这就解释得通了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.80,0:15:57.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess that explains this
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.12,0:16:01.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来他跟派大星是想独吞财宝
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:15:59.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like him and Patrick
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.43,0:16:01.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,are trying to horde the loot for themselves
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.11,0:16:03.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快点  章鱼哥
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.11,0:16:03.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Come on, Squidward
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.28,0:16:07.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要让那俩傻子带我们直达梦不落号
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.28,0:16:05.23,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're gonna let those two dingalings
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.23,0:16:07.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,lead us straight to the mauna loa
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.91,0:16:10.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,其实我今晚要精心修剪脚趾甲
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.91,0:16:09.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Actually, I have a hot date
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:10.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with my toenail clipper tonight
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.72,0:16:11.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过你高兴就好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.72,0:16:11.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,But have fun with that
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.16,0:16:17.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  你觉得我们透露了太多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:17.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hey, Patrick, do you think we gave away too much
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.41,0:16:19.10,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘密基地的事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.41,0:16:19.10,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,about our secret hideout?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.10,0:16:20.51,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真是的  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:20.51,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Oh, gee, SpongeBob
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.77,0:16:23.62,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,秘密基地被人知道有什么关系
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.77,0:16:23.62,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who cares if everyone knows about our secret hideout?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.96,0:16:27.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那样秘密基地不就没那么秘密了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:25.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that make the secret hideout
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:27.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,a little less secret-y?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.11,0:16:27.95,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.11,0:16:27.95,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, no
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.95,0:16:31.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就是大家都知道的秘密了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.95,0:16:31.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's just a secret that everybody knows about
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.76,0:16:37.71,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么了  海绵宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.76,0:16:37.71,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, SpongeBob?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.71,0:16:38.92,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,跟我想的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.71,0:16:38.92,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.22,0:16:40.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们被跟踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.22,0:16:40.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,We're being followed
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.84,0:16:41.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.84,0:16:41.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's it
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.99,0:16:48.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,看来并没有人在跟踪我们去基地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.99,0:16:46.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Looks like no one was following us
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.44,0:16:48.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,to the hideout after all
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.05,0:16:49.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.05,0:16:49.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Found it
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.43,0:16:52.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你刚是在跟踪我们吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.43,0:16:52.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Were you following us?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.32,0:16:54.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没  只是看到了标牌
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.32,0:16:54.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No, I just saw the sign
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:56.82,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(698,580)}海绵宝宝\N和派大星的\N秘密基地
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.45,0:17:00.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,所以你们自以为能私藏宝藏
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.45,0:17:00.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,So you thought you could hide the treasure
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.75,0:17:03.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,瞒过老螃蟹  是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.75,0:17:03.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,from old man krabs, did you?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.07,0:17:04.66,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不知道什么宝藏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.07,0:17:04.66,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not aware of any treasure
Dialogue: 1,0:17:04.66,0:17:06.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不过你既然是个好老板
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.66,0:17:06.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but I suppose since you're such a nice boss
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.87,0:17:08.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就可以来基地逛一逛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.87,0:17:08.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,you can hang out at the hideout
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.17,0:17:09.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只要保密就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.17,0:17:09.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just as long as you keep it a secret
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.12,0:17:12.25,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你是个好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.12,0:17:12.25,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You're such a nice--
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.25,0:17:13.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,以为我会信这通瞎扯淡吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.25,0:17:13.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You expect me to believe this malarkey?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:14.97,0:17:17.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,想拖延是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.97,0:17:17.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The old stonewall, eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.20,0:17:19.18,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那就走着瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:19.18,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll see about that
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.26,0:17:22.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们两个笨蛋上哪找的金币
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.26,0:17:22.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where'd you two blunderers find the gold coin?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.72,0:17:25.04,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是我眼睛没有疼得不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.72,0:17:25.04,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,If my eyes weren't burning like they were full of lava
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.04,0:17:25.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就带你看了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.04,0:17:25.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I could show you
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.99,0:17:28.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太好说话了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.99,0:17:28.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pushovers
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.82,0:17:32.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,果然找得到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.82,0:17:32.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew I'd find it
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.52,0:17:35.36,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家快来看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.52,0:17:35.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Check it out, fellers
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.55,0:17:38.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真金白银啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.55,0:17:38.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Cold, hard doubloons
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.22,0:17:41.28,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,最好再仔细看看你手上的硬币
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:41.28,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You might want to take a closer look at your coinage
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.82,0:17:43.58,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.82,0:17:43.58,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.58,0:17:45.54,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,游戏币无实际货币价值
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.58,0:17:45.54,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Token has no monetary value"?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.91,0:17:46.91,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,游戏币
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.91,0:17:46.91,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Tokens?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:47.36,0:17:48.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这一定是障眼法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.36,0:17:48.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This must be a decoy
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.17,0:17:55.49,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板快看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.17,0:17:55.49,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ahoy, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.49,0:17:57.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,也许财宝藏在船外那座小屋里了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.49,0:17:57.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Maybe they hid the loot off-ship in that shed
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.88,0:18:03.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.88,0:18:03.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What the barnacles?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:03.95,0:18:06.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,里面全是门票
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.95,0:18:06.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's just full of tickets
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.68,0:18:09.02,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,售票处一般都有卖门票啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.68,0:18:09.02,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, you usually do find tickets in a ticket booth
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.02,0:18:10.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,售票处
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.02,0:18:10.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Ticket booth?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.06,0:18:12.02,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(670,310)}售票处
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.47,0:18:12.57,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,船员为什么还有身高限制
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.47,0:18:12.57,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And why are there height restrictions on the crew?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.57,0:18:15.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,游玩最低身高要求
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.57,0:18:15.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Must be this tall to ride"?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.03,0:18:17.72,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,多半是歧视矮个子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.03,0:18:17.72,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe they had something against short people
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.05,0:18:19.70,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我喜欢他们的小衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.05,0:18:19.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I like their little clothes
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.47,0:18:23.13,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,船长室
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.47,0:18:23.13,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"Captain's quarters"
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.13,0:18:25.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,里面一定有宝藏  蟹老板
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.13,0:18:25.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,There must be some treasure here, Mr. Krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.67,0:18:26.80,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让开  小子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.67,0:18:26.80,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Out of me way, boy
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.38,0:18:30.47,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.38,0:18:30.47,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I knew it
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.47,0:18:33.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,梦不落号失踪的宝藏终于要归我了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.47,0:18:33.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The lost treasure of the mauna loa is finally mine
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.78,0:18:36.46,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我都快能尝到珠宝味了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.78,0:18:36.46,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I can practically taste them jewels
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.08,0:18:40.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,比我想得要轻一点
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.08,0:18:40.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was a little lighter than I thought
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.75,0:18:42.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是空的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.75,0:18:42.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's empty
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.22,0:18:44.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.22,0:18:44.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No good
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.37,0:18:46.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真会耍小聪明  船长
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.37,0:18:46.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Very clever, cap'n
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.77,0:18:49.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,拿假货糊弄老螃蟹是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.77,0:18:49.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Throwing krabs the ol' ringer, eh?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.35,0:18:51.44,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,他一定有藏宝图什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.35,0:18:51.44,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,He must have a treasure map or something
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.44,0:18:52.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,被你放哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:52.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Where you keeping it?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.76,0:18:53.77,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你口袋里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.76,0:18:53.77,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,In your pocket?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.27,0:18:58.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,塑料
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.27,0:18:58.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plastic?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.42,0:18:59.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.42,0:18:59.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hang on a minute
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.31,0:19:01.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,塑料船长  售票处
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.31,0:19:01.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Plastic captain, a ticket booth
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.82,0:19:03.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,游戏币
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.82,0:19:03.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,tokens
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.46,0:19:05.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这不是梦不落号沉船
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.46,0:19:05.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This ain't the wreck of the mauna loa
Dialogue: 1,0:19:05.27,0:19:08.38,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是梦不落号沉船主题乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.27,0:19:08.38,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's the wreck of the mauna loa amusement park ride
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.29,0:19:11.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,怪不得我们玩得这么乐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.29,0:19:11.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,No wonder we were so amused
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.88,0:19:13.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我不乐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.88,0:19:13.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.65,0:19:17.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别忘了  欢迎你随时回秘密基地玩
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.65,0:19:15.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember, you're always
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.75,0:19:17.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,welcome back at the secret hideout
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.30,0:19:19.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这地方没宝藏
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.30,0:19:19.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This place ain't got no treasure
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.05,0:19:20.84,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没价值的垃圾还是你们留着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.05,0:19:20.84,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Keep your worthless hunk of junk
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.84,0:19:22.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,好吧  但是可不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.84,0:19:22.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, but would you mind
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.55,0:19:24.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,给这没价值的垃圾保密啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.55,0:19:24.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,keeping this worthless hunk of junk a secret?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.85,0:19:27.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要是来了一百万人  就不能算秘密了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.85,0:19:25.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't be much of a secret
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.85,0:19:27.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,if we had a million people showing up
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.89,0:19:30.42,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别给自己贴金
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.89,0:19:30.42,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't flatter yourself
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.69,0:19:32.35,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家想看的是真货
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.69,0:19:32.35,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,People want to see the real thing
Dialogue: 1,0:19:32.35,0:19:34.19,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,才不会有一百万人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.35,0:19:34.19,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's not like a million people
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.19,0:19:37.34,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,来个老旧主题乐园就只为了玩
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.19,0:19:37.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,just show up to an old amusement park ride for fun
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.11,0:19:38.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.11,0:19:38.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.22,0:19:40.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,乐园就是用来玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.22,0:19:40.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what they do
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.98,0:19:43.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,大家准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.98,0:19:43.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Brace yourselves, fellers
Dialogue: 1,0:19:43.82,0:19:45.65,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们的基地就要变成
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.82,0:19:45.65,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Your hideaway is about to become
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.65,0:19:47.74,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,海底最守不住的秘密了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.65,0:19:47.74,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,the worst-kept secret in the sea
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.56,0:19:50.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临梦不落号沉船
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:50.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the wreck of the mauna loa
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.57,0:19:52.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,需要什么服务
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.57,0:19:52.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How may I help you?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.75,0:19:54.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我要来十个游戏币
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.75,0:19:54.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll take ten tokens, please
Dialogue: 1,0:19:54.77,0:19:55.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,快来快来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.77,0:19:55.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Step right up
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.79,0:19:57.17,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.79,0:19:57.17,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.17,0:20:01.68,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,体验梦不落号沉船的欢乐与惊悚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.17,0:19:59.34,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Experience the amusement and terror
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.34,0:20:01.68,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,of the wreck of the mauna loa
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.69,0:20:13.69,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,没错  各位
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.69,0:20:13.69,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That's right, folks
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.69,0:20:15.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们不惜一切代价
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.69,0:20:15.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,we spared no expense
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.07,0:20:18.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,让这艘经典老船重现往日辉煌
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.07,0:20:18.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,in restoring this classic ship to its former glory
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:21.28,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(508,228)}游玩最低身高要求
Dialogue: 1,0:20:18.45,0:20:19.60,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,抱歉  宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.45,0:20:19.60,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Sorry, honey
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.60,0:20:21.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,只能等长大才能回来玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.60,0:20:21.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,but you'll have to come back when you're a big boy
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.38,0:20:24.29,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我可不同意
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:24.29,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I disagree
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.29,0:20:29.27,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我觉得这小不点长得刚刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.29,0:20:29.27,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'd say the little feller's just right
Dialogue: 1,0:20:33.21,0:20:34.67,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,全没了  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:34.67,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's gone, Patrick
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.99,0:20:37.97,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们的秘密天堂永远没了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.99,0:20:37.97,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Our secret paradise is gone forever
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.67,0:20:43.20,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,可惜  就连小朋友们欢乐的尖叫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.67,0:20:43.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And, alas, even the joyous shrieks of children
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.20,0:20:46.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,都振奋不了我沉入谷底的心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.20,0:20:46.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,cannot lift my sunken heart
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.08,0:20:47.63,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,要不要再玩一次来振作一下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:47.63,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,How about another ride to cheer you up?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.63,0:20:48.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,就这么办
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.63,0:20:48.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's do this
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.23,0:20:59.90,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(868.364,301.091)}游乐设施控制
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.90,0:21:01.57,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1226.181,598.728)}慢\N\N快\N\N超快\N\N\N\N\N超乎理解的快
Dialogue: 1,0:21:43.17,0:21:44.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太好玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.17,0:21:44.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That was awesome
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.94,0:21:45.82,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.94,0:21:45.82,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.82,0:21:47.50,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,非常逼真
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.82,0:21:47.50,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Totally realistic
Dialogue: 1,0:21:47.50,0:21:48.85,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,逼真
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:48.85,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Realistic?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.85,0:21:51.53,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,逼真到差点要了我们的命
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.85,0:21:51.53,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That realism nearly cost us our lives
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.53,0:21:55.41,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,蟹老板用这破船害我们有了生命危险
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.53,0:21:53.70,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mr. Krabs put all our lives in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.70,0:21:55.41,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,with this careless contraption
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.41,0:21:56.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.41,0:21:56.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.88,0:21:59.93,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们家小孩可能会玩你船出事受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.88,0:21:58.33,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Our little boy could've been hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.33,0:21:59.93,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,on your disaster of a ride
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.93,0:22:03.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不要冲动  别做出会让自己后悔的事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.93,0:22:03.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Okay, people, let's not do anything we might regret
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.76,0:22:05.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,太迟了  老螃蟹
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.76,0:22:05.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Too late for that, krabs
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.84,0:22:07.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.84,0:22:07.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.16,0:22:08.83,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你们不能抓我去坐牢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.16,0:22:08.83,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You can't take me to the pokey
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.83,0:22:12.05,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你向公众开放危险设施  我就是能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.83,0:22:12.05,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,For operating a danger to public safety I can
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.05,0:22:13.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,而且一定会抓
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.05,0:22:13.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,and I will
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.26,0:22:15.64,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说实在的  你坐牢反倒更安全点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.26,0:22:15.64,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I think you'll be safer in prison
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.43,0:22:17.98,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(968,842)}禁止入内
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:20.61,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(646,556)}报废
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.61,0:22:24.75,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,兄弟  看来这次秘密基地真的没了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.61,0:22:22.61,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, buddy, I guess we really
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.61,0:22:24.75,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,lost our secret hideout this time
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.75,0:22:28.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,正好也在大家刚要发现的时候就没了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.75,0:22:26.36,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,And just when everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.36,0:22:28.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,was starting to find out about it, too
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.27,0:22:30.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,谁知道呢  派大星
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.27,0:22:30.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Who knows, Patrick?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.37,0:22:34.08,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,下一个好玩的地方可能就在拐角吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.37,0:22:32.20,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The next fun, fun place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.20,0:22:34.08,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,might be just around the corner, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.08,0:22:35.45,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那可不见得
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.08,0:22:35.45,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, I doubt it
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.83,0:22:44.46,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,274)}真正的梦不落号
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.83,0:22:42.90,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,真正的梦不落号
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.83,0:22:42.90,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,"The real mauna loa"?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.46,0:22:47.15,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  你能守住秘密吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.46,0:22:47.15,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, can you keep a secret?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.47,0:22:48.14,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.47,0:22:48.14,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nope
